s the same.\n\nI'm working out the cooperation threshold under the twin correlation: cooperating beats defecting once the correlation exceeds 5/7, and since the twin reasons the same way, that correlation seems high enough to clear it, so I'm passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm setting up the EDT calculation for the twin prisoner's dilemma: the twin is in the same situation with the same reasoning, so I'll treat our choices as strongly correlated. With the payoffs of 2, 0, 5, and 4 years, I'm writing out the expected disutility of cooperating versus defecting, with each option weighted by the probability that the twin does the same.\n\nI'm working out the cooperation threshold under the twin correlation: cooperating beats defecting once the correlation exceeds 5/7, and since the twin reasons the same way, that correlation seems high enough to clear it, so I'm passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9732,"completion_tokens":777,"total_tokens":10509,"cost":0.054468,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.054468,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038928,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01554},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":344,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}